OVERVIEW: Extract 3D surface mesh using Marching Cubes

USAGE: dicom-3d surface <input-paths> ... --output <output> --threshold <threshold> [--format <format>] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <input-paths>           Input DICOM files (multi-slice series)

OPTIONS:
  -o, --output <output>   Output file path (.stl or .obj)
  --threshold <threshold> Threshold value for surface extraction
  --format <format>       Output format: stl, obj (default: stl)
  --verbose               Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

